Today is Monday.
It is morning, and I am going to the office.
I stand at the bus stop and wait.
My regular bus arrives.
I enter the bus and sit down there.
The conductor comes near me.
I give him twenty rupees.
He gives me the ticket.
I put the ticket in my bag.
I look outside from the window.
The streets of Mumbai are very busy today.
I remember the month of January.
When I first came to Mumbai, everything was new.
Back then, this city was very big and noisy.
Seeing the crowd of people, I was scared.
But now I do not feel fear.
Now this daily travel is easy for me.
I know this route very well.
Now Mumbai feels like my own city.
